; One variable: `light_mask` on a Control. A light reaches an item whose `light_mask` meets the
; light's `range_item_cull_mask` (`renderer_canvas_render_rd.cpp:2366`), and a Control has the
; property like any CanvasItem. The two ColorRects match in everything else, so the masked one stays
; at its authored colour. No other golden masks a Control.

